              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Abisirayeli batera Abafilisitiya, basagaza ahabangikanye n’i Ebenezeri; Abafilisitiya na bo basagaza kuri Afeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 28:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisitiya batonda urugamba ngo barwanye Abisirayeli: bamaze kurumana, Abisirayeli baneshwa n’ Abafilisitiya, Abafilisitiya babicamw’ abantu nk’ibihumbi bine mur’ urwo rugamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.18.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 18:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.3.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 3:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.11.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 11:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ingabo zishitse mu nsago, abakuru bo mu Bisirayeli barabazanya, bati N’iki gitumye Uhoraho yemera ko tuneshwa uyu musi n’Abafilisitiya? Enda ni muze tuje kuzana isandugu y’isezerano ry’Uhoraho tuyikūre i Shilo, tuyizane hano, kugira ngo ni yashika muri twebge idutabare ububasha bg’abansi bacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
