              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw iyo sandugu y’isezerano ry’Uhoraho ishitse aho bashagaje, Abisirayeli bose baca biha akamo icarimwe, isi irāsīra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Abafilisitiya bumvise urwo rwamo, barabazanya, bat’ Urwo rwamo rwinshi ruri mu nsago z’Abaheburayo n’urw’ iki? Hanyuma bamenya kw ar’ isandugu y’Uhoraho ishitse mur’ izo nsago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Abafilisitiya baratinya, bat’ Imana irashitse mu nsago zabo! Bat’ Erega turapfuye! Nta ho twaribgabone nk’ivyo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.24.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 24:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 11:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka turapfuye! Ni nde yodukiza akadukūra mu maboko y’izo mana zihambaye? Izo ni za mana zāzaniye Abanyegiputa ivyago bitari bimwe mu bugaragwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
