          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 14:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Eli yar’ amaze imyaka mirongwicenda n’umunani; amaso yiwe yar’ ahumye, ntiyar’ akibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo muntu abarira Eli, ati Ni jewe mvuye mu rugamba, nje mpunga mvuye mu ntambara uyu musi. Aramubaza, ati Vyagenze bite ga mwana wanje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo mbitsi iramwishura, it’ Abisirayeli batsinzwe n’ Abafilisitiya, habaye agatikizo gakomeye mu bantu; ba bahungu bawe bompi Hofuni na Finehasi bapfuye; kand’ isandugu y’Imana yafashwe mpiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw amaze kuvuga ivy’ isandugu y’Imana, Eli ahanuka ku ntebe yiwe, agwa agaramye ku gikingi c’irembo, akenyura izosi, arahwera; kuko yar’ umutāma, kandi yari yiremereye. Yar’ amaze imyaka mirongwine ar’ umucamanza w’Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
